ed result\n\nThis is a disposable synthetic role in the Harness governed-smoke fixture. It\nproves provider launch and typed-result transport only. It has no authority over\nany real project.\n\n1. Call the Harness `assignment` tool once.\n2. Read `marker.txt` in your working directory. Do not modify any file.\n3. Call the Harness `submitResult` tool with exactly\n   `{\"disposition\":\"succeeded\",\"methodology\":{\"smoke\":\"PASS\"}}`.\n4. Stop.\n"}},"smoke-claude-promotion":{"policy":{"contract":"methodology/contracts/smoke-claude-promotion.json","skill":"methodology/skills/smoke-claude-promotion.md","when":{"not":{"event":"claude-smoked"}},"retry":{"dispositions":[],"limit":0},"onAllocate":{"transition":"smoke-allocated","fromInputs":{"candidate":"candidate"},"counterField":"attempt"},"outcomes":[{"disposition":"succeeded","methodology":{"smoke":"PASS"},"transition":"claude-smoked","requiredActions":["promotion"]}]},"contract":{"schemaVersion":1,"workspaces":["repository","private"],"capabilities":["repository-read"],"forbiddenExposure":[],"protected":true,"inputs":[{"name":"candidate","path":"candidate.txt"},{"name":"revision","path":"smoke-plan.json","jsonValue":"revision"}],"results":["succeeded","blocked","refused","failed"],"methodology":{"smoke":["PASS","FAIL"]},"human":[],"postconditions":[],"promotion":{"sourceWorkspace":"private","destinationWorkspace":"repository","destination":"promoted","candidateInput":"candidate","revisionInput":"revision","when":{"smoke":"PASS"},"allocationEvent":"smoke-allocated","attemptField":"attempt","transition":"smoke-promotion-recorded"}},"contractIdentity":"sha256:70a7b4f0dbfb6c43dcc9daf397153cc0553fc1e575d4c13cb946f960137b1918","skill":{"path":"methodology/skills/smoke-claude-promotion.md","identity":"sha256:dc9767845d24950aee0f4142b3e0085fa852262d47ca7560edff81084d1b57e8","content":"# Synthetic smoke role: Claude typed result and host promotion\n\nThis is a disposable synthetic role in the Harness governed-smoke fixture